SmartSqlMap.Select:
select cast(reference_id as nvarchar(36)) as reference_id, deployment_id, deployment_name, process_definition_key, process_definition_name, tenant_id, is_draft, deploy_time, decision_key, task_id, task_name, binding_mode, version_tag, indexed_time from process_decision_reference
decision_key = #{decisionKey}
and tenant_id = #{tenantId}
and is_draft = 0
and deployment_id in
#{item}
order by is_draft desc, deploy_time desc, deployment_name asc, process_definition_key asc, task_id asc
